achtige en heldere audio en is geschikt voor het aansluiten van verschillende audiobronnen zoals cd-spelers, platenspelers en andere geluidsapparatuur.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"77cks5\" data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"335\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"354\"><strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"354\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4uww7o\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"371\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"529\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k2pq9v\" data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"405\">⭐ Krachtige stereo versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5l8k03\" data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"452\">⭐ Heldere en gebalanceerde geluidsweergave</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rdb1go\" data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"499\">⭐ Geschikt voor verschillende audiobronnen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ktsgzl\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"529\">⭐ Degelijke bouwkwaliteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ea4dwa\" data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"551\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncs2f7\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"589\">\r\n<p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"589\"><strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"571\">Merk & model:</strong> Denon PMA-1500R</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fnttct\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"621\"><strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"601\">Type:</strong> Stereo versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47t8x5\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"654\"><strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"637\">Vermogen:</strong> ± 2 × 70W (8Ω)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pbcmhk\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"684\"><strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"670\">Ingangen:</strong> RCA / Phono</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bfro5x\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"713\"><strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"697\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart / Black</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvg5qz\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"743\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"726\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ego49q\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"763\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wtq7xh\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"778\">Versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3nyzao\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"802\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"835\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
